# Claude AI generated files. Everything under .claude/ is local-only EXCEPT
# .claude/skills/, which is version-controlled so shared skills travel with the repo.
# Memory (.claude/projects/) stays ignored: it may hold real operator/merchant context.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Admin API credentials. `.env` is the standard secrets file every script here reads via
# `node --env-file=.env ...` (SHOPIFY_CLIENT_ID, SHOPIFY_CLIENT_SECRET, MYSHOPIFY_DOMAIN).
# Deliberately UNANCHORED and covering variants: a `.env` anywhere in this public repo is a
# credential leak, and the file existed as a convention before any rule ignored it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# npm
node_modules/
npm-debug.log
.npm/

# Shopify CLI local state
.shopify/

# Local diagnostics output. The probe SCRIPT is safe to commit; its LOG may hold
# storefront session/redirect data, so the log stays local-only.
/scripts/diagnostics/*.log

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# blank-inventory working directory: plan artifacts and apply receipts. These reference live
# variant ids and real blank ids (which embed supplier data), so they stay local-only.
# The tool now defaults this directory OUTSIDE the repo (see scripts/blank-inventory/lib/workdir.mjs),
# so nothing should match here at all. Deliberately UNANCHORED as a backstop: the previous
# root-anchored form missed `scripts/blank-inventory/.blank-inventory/`, which an older cwd-relative
# run created and left untracked-but-stageable in this public repo.
.blank-inventory/

# Product image processing: raw + processed binaries + manifest never enter the repo
# (Shopify's CDN is their home). Anchored to the repo root so it ignores only the top-level
# image folder, not the like-named `.claude/skills/product-images/` skill or theme assets/.
# The script refuses to write outside a product-images/ path.
/product-images/
